1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,200
Forgotten password: reset and sign in.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,238
Request a reset link, verify your
identity, choose a new password,

3
00:00:08,238 --> 00:00:10,012
and sign in again.

4
00:00:11,606 --> 00:00:13,641
Choose Forgot your password?

5
00:00:13,641 --> 00:00:15,095
on the sign-in page.

6
00:00:15,095 --> 00:00:20,766
A reset needs access to your account
email and your authenticator or an unused

7
00:00:20,766 --> 00:00:22,183
recovery code.

8
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:26,589
Enter your MERIT user name and
choose Email me a reset link.

9
00:00:26,589 --> 00:00:30,836
Use your user name rather than
guessing an email address.

10
00:00:31,192 --> 00:00:36,339
The same Check your email message
appears whether an account exists or not.

11
00:00:36,339 --> 00:00:37,642
Check junk or spam.

12
00:00:37,642 --> 00:00:38,642
No email?

13
00:00:38,642 --> 00:00:42,281
Check your user name and
contact your administrator.

14
00:00:42,581 --> 00:00:44,996
Open the link from the newest email.

15
00:00:44,996 --> 00:00:47,478
It works once and for the time shown.

16
00:00:47,478 --> 00:00:52,171
The email itself is kept off
camera because the link is private.

17
00:00:52,539 --> 00:00:54,724
The link alone is not enough.

18
00:00:54,724 --> 00:00:58,943
Enter an authenticator code,
or an unused recovery code.

19
00:00:58,943 --> 00:01:03,186
A recovery code is used up
when the reset succeeds.

20
00:01:03,541 --> 00:01:09,036
A wrong verification code leaves the
password unchanged and uses an attempt on

21
00:01:09,036 --> 00:01:10,036
this link.

22
00:01:10,036 --> 00:01:12,620
Read the error before retrying.

23
00:01:16,038 --> 00:01:19,978
Choose a long passphrase
that meets the minimum shown.

24
00:01:19,978 --> 00:01:22,459
Enter the same new password twice.

25
00:01:22,459 --> 00:01:26,070
MERIT also rejects known
breached passwords.

26
00:01:28,037 --> 00:01:32,517
Correct the fields, enter a current
code, and choose Reset password.

27
00:01:32,517 --> 00:01:37,528
MERIT confirms the reset and signs
out other sessions on this account.

28
00:01:40,713 --> 00:01:43,049
A reset link cannot be used again.

29
00:01:43,049 --> 00:01:47,848
If you did not make the reset,
contact your MERIT administrator.

30
00:01:48,201 --> 00:01:49,554
Go back to sign in.

31
00:01:49,554 --> 00:01:53,683
Use your new password, then
the normal authenticator step.

32
00:01:53,683 --> 00:01:57,002
Resetting a password does not remove MFA.

33
00:02:01,197 --> 00:02:05,310
In this video you requested and
opened a private reset link,

34
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:10,451
verified identity and corrected password
errors, and signed in with the new

35
00:02:10,451 --> 00:02:12,702
password and second factor.
